            "caption": "4 AI Agents To Automate 99% Of Your Life. Automate everyday workflows using AI agents without needing coding skills. The first pillar, Coordination, focuses on managing your Gmail inbox and Google Calendar to reclaim your daily focus. It teaches how to build agents that review unread emails, sort them into priority buckets, and draft intelligent responses. The second pillar, Creativity, turns rough notes into formatted pitch decks and professional documents using predefined skills. This allows you to rapidly build PowerPoint presentations while maintaining control over the direction and brand style. The third pillar, Clarity, helps analyze complex contracts, legal documents, and market research. It uses a microscope approach to break down dense text into plain-English risk assessments and structured summaries. The fourth pillar, Coaching, utilizes voice mode to simulate job interviews, negotiations, or high-stakes business meetings. By roleplaying with AI personas, you can practice your responses out loud and receive constructive feedback. #artificialintelligence #tecnologia #aiagents #automatic #Future #Productivity #airsoft #aidangallagher #ai",
